---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ProfileForm from "../../components/account/ProfileForm";
import AuthCta from "../../components/account/AuthCta";
import AccountSecurityPanel from "../../components/account/AccountSecurityPanel";
import DeleteAccountPanel from "../../components/account/DeleteAccountPanel";
import "../../styles/account-delete.css";
import "../../styles/account-editorial.css";
---
<BaseLayout design="editorial" title="Profil" noindex={true}>
  <div class="em-account">
    <header class="em-heading"><p class="ed-kicker">Dein Konto</p><h1>Dein Profil.</h1><p>So zeigst du dich in der Community. Bearbeite deinen Nickname, deine Bio und deinen Avatar.</p></header>
    <nav class="em-nav" aria-label="Kontobereich"><a href="/account/profile" aria-current="page">Profil</a><a href="/account/access">Meine Zugänge</a><a href="/account/notifications">Benachrichtigungen</a></nav>
    <div class="em-profile-layout">
      <div><ProfileForm client:load /><noscript><p>Bitte aktiviere JavaScript, um dein Profil zu laden und zu bearbeiten.</p></noscript></div>
      <aside class="em-sidebar">
        <section class="em-side-note"><p class="ed-kicker">Dein Quartett online</p><h2>Deine Zugänge.</h2><p>Sieh nach, welche Inhalte für dich freigeschaltet sind, oder verschenke einen weiteren Deck-Zugang.</p><a class="ed-button" href="/account/access">Zugänge verwalten <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>
        <details class="em-disclosure"><summary>Was sehen andere von mir?</summary><p>Dein Nickname, deine Bio und dein ausgewählter Avatar sind öffentlich sichtbar. Das gilt auch für deine Threads und Kommentare.</p><p>Deine E-Mail-Adresse und Anmeldedaten werden im Forum nicht angezeigt.</p></details>
        <AuthCta client:idle variant="profile" />
      </aside>
    </div>
    <div class="em-security"><AccountSecurityPanel client:visible /></div>
    <DeleteAccountPanel client:visible />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .account-security-panel,
  .account-security-panel *,
  .account-security-panel *::before,
  .account-security-panel *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .account-security-panel {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin-top: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
  }

  .account-security-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  .account-security-header h2,
  .account-security-card h3,
  .account-session-card h3 {
    margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
  }

  .account-security-header > p {
    max-width: 470px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted, #aeb9b0);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .account-security-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .account-security-card,
  .account-session-card {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.3rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    border: 1px solid var(--border, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12));
    border-radius: 20px;
    background: var(--surface, #121814);
  }

  .account-security-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .account-security-card p,
  .account-session-card p {
    color: var(--muted, #aeb9b0);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .current-account-email {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
    color: var(--text, #f3f7f2);
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .account-security-card label {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: var(--text, #f3f7f2);
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  .account-security-card input {
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.85rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13));
    border-radius: 11px;
    color: var(--text, #f3f7f2);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.055);
    font: inherit;
  }

  .account-security-card input:focus {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent, #7effcb);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .account-security-card button,
  .account-session-card button {
    width: fit-content;
    max-width: 100%;
    min-height: 46px;
    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 11px;
    color: #07110d;
    background: var(--accent, #7effcb);
    font: inherit;
    font-weight: 850;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .account-security-card button:disabled,
  .account-session-card button:disabled {
    cursor: not-allowed;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .account-session-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem 2rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .account-session-card .account-security-message {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
  }

  .account-security-message {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.8rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 11px;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .account-security-message.is-error {
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 103, 103, 0.34);
    color: #ffc0c0;
    background: rgba(255, 82, 82, 0.09);
  }

  .account-security-message.is-success {
    border: 1px solid rgba(126, 255, 203, 0.3);
    color: #baffdf;
    background: rgba(126, 255, 203, 0.07);
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .account-security-header {
      display: block;
    }

    .account-security-header > p {
      margin-top: 0.9rem;
    }

    .account-security-grid,
    .account-session-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .account-session-card button {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    .account-security-card,
    .account-session-card {
      padding: 1.15rem;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .account-security-card button {
      width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
